        {
          "stepNumber": 3,
          "shortLabel": "吞异常",
          "badge": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "submit() 会悄悄吞掉你的异常",
          "paragraphs": [
            "`submit(task)` 把任务包成 `FutureTask`。它的 `run()` 里 `catch (Throwable ex)` 后调用 `setException(ex)` —— 异常被**存进 Future 的 outcome 字段**，不打印、不抛出、没有任何日志。任务失败得像什么都没发生。",
            "只有调用 `future.get()` 时，异常才会以 `ExecutionException` 的形式浮现。如果你 submit 之后从不 get（fire-and-forget 写法），异常就永远沉默。这是线程池排障的第一大坑。",
            "三条兜底路线：① 需要结果就**必须 get()**；② 重写 `afterExecute(Runnable r, Throwable t)`，对 FutureTask 主动 get 提取异常；③ 用 `execute()` 提交 + 自定义 `ThreadFactory` 设置 `UncaughtExceptionHandler`。"
          ],
          "callout": {
            "kind": "warn",
            "text": "`execute()` 提交的 Runnable 抛异常会终止当前 Worker（池随后补线程），默认打印堆栈；`submit()` 则完全静默。两者行为差异巨大。"
          },
          "diffs": [
            {
              "kind": "add",
              "text": "FutureTask.run() catch Throwable → setException"
            },
            {
              "kind": "add",
              "text": "异常仅在 future.get() 时以 ExecutionException 抛出"
            }
          ],
          "sourceDrawer": {
            "title": "afterExecute 兜底模板",
            "filePath": "java/util/concurrent/ThreadPoolExecutor.java",
            "githubUrl": "https://github.com/openjdk/jdk/blob/master/src/java.base/share/classes/java/util/concurrent/ThreadPoolExecutor.java",
            "language": "java",
            "code": "new ThreadPoolExecutor(...) {\n    @Override\n    protected void afterExecute(Runnable r, Throwable t) {\n        super.afterExecute(r, t);\n        if (t == null && r instanceof Future<?> f) {\n            try {\n                if (f.isDone()) f.get();\n            } catch (CancellationException ce) {\n                t = ce;\n            } catch (ExecutionException ee) {\n                t = ee.getCause();\n            } catch (InterruptedException ie) {\n                Thread.currentThread().interrupt();\n            }\n        }\n        if (t != null) log.error(\"task failed\", t);\n    }\n};",
            "caption": "JDK 文档官方推荐的异常兜底写法：submit 的异常藏在 Future 里，要主动挖出来。"
          },
